  <!--Original=Remnants of the mechanoid mind in {PAWN_nameDef}&apos;s {IMPLANT} have awakened and refuse to submit to you. The part is now uncontrollable.\n\nReprogram it using the operation or the biosculptor before it is too late: left alone, the rebellion spreads to other mechanoid parts.-->
